WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.089
Identify moral lessons and faith-based benefits described when people answer God’s

00:00:05.089 --> 00:00:05.533
call.

00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:11.584
The curriculum presents believers’ views of benefits such as drawing closer to God

00:00:11.584 --> 00:00:17.203
and hopes for long life, prosperity or eternal life. These are faith teachings, not

00:00:17.203 --> 00:00:19.209
guaranteed outcomes that everyone experiences.

00:00:20.033 --> 00:00:25.201
Shared moral lessons include obedience, sacrifice, respect, commitment and humility.

00:00:25.201 --> 00:00:29.335
Learners can demonstrate these values in everyday kindness.

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:35.576
In pairs, role-play showing humility, respect or sacrifice in an everyday situation.
